&P302901 = OLA 220, 432-433 
#atf: lang sux 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. mu ri-im-{d}a-nu-um lugal-e 
#tr.en: The year in which King Rim-Anum, 
2. ma-da e-mu-ut-ba-lum# ugnim# esz3-nun-na i3-si-in{ki} ka-zal-lu e-ne-bi-ta-gin7 
#tr.en: the (forces of) the land of Emutbalum, the armies of Eshnunna, Isin and Kazallu, as if all together (with him), 
3. unu{ki}-sze3 me3-a in-szi-su8-esz-am3# 
#tr.en: having presented themselves at Uruk for war, 
4. gar3#-dar# erin2-na-bi# mi-ni-in-gar-ra 
#tr.en: inflicted a defeat upon their troops. 
5. nig2-ul-du3-a-ta# unu{ki} sahar-ra la-ba-dub#?-ab#?-ba 
#tr.en: Since time immemorial Uruk had never experienced (such) a dust storm (raised by a foreign army), 
6. sahar ba-dub?-ba-a-ba mi#-ni#-in#-szar2#-szar2-re 
#tr.en: but after the dust storm settled, he slaughtered (all of them) 
7. nam-a2-gal2-la-a-ni kalam-ma mi#-ni-in#-ri#-a 
#tr.en: and by his power ejected (them all) from the homeland. 
@reverse 
$ blank

